{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">港股收復兩萬四關口。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">恒指高開155點後，最多升過350點，上試24,100點水平。科網股造好，騰訊及阿里巴巴，分別升逾百分之1。小米旗下新車款，一個月銷量突破7萬部，股價曾急升百分之9。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T06:00:58.774638+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}